You have reflection and MR. Mind flayers are minimal danger if you 
keep your distance/park an an E-square--and your lightsaber can burn 
a permanent E-graving. If you're parked on an E-square, the only real 
way for a MF to hurt you directly is locking onto your 
mind/telepathy, which only does d15 damage, so it likely won't kill 
you if you watch your HP. (A couple other quick suggestions: greased 
helmet, polyself into headless monster.)

Of course, a MF can still use attack items, even if you're on an E-
square, but the MR/reflection combo mitigates most wands, leaving 
mainly potions. Of those, the most worrysome are sleep and paralysis 
(I don't see free action in your intrinsics, and you explicitly 
mentioned no sleep resistance), which can leave you vulnerable to 
hard-hitting, E-ignoring monsters, like minotaurs.
